id=ota_block
name=OTA Block (ccc.ota egress + update_engine stop)
version=v2
versionCode=2
author=gpower26-cluster-pub
description=At each boot: DROP all network for com.motorola.ccc.ota (IPv4+IPv6), disable auto system update, stop the update_engine A/B apply daemon, and null-route Motorola OTA/CCC hosts via a systemless /system/etc/hosts overlay. ccc.ota is a protected priv-app pm cannot remove; this is the durable block. Authoritative farm-wide block is LAN DNS (AdGuard).
